790867479, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792561155081, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "c00A", "text": "Prototipo de 2 h · Web simulada: 2 celulares lado a lado · Aura Rest (app) · Aura TermoSleep (sábana) · Aura Sensor", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Prototipo de 2 h · Web simulada: 2 celulares lado a lado · Aura Rest (app) · Aura TermoSleep (sábana) · Aura Sensor", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "aura_00011", "type": "rectangle", "x": 0, "y": 140, "width": 620, "height": 290, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#d0ebff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1566649337, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 2006351246, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792561155081, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "c00B"}, {"id": "aura_00012", "type": "text", "x": 16, "y": 154, "width": 93.60000000000001, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 145187354, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 1209764783, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792561155081, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "c00C", "text": "Decisiones", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Decisiones", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "aura_00013", "type": "text", "x": 16, "y": 186, "width": 413.40000000000003, "height": 131.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 921346867, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 909861293, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792561155081, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "c00D", "text": "• Dos apps: Cuidadora (pasiva) y Hijo/a (control)\n• Cuidadora: solo 3 cosas — Dormir, Sonidos,\n  Mi descanso. Sin mensajes, sin alertas\n• Hijo/a hace el setup y aplica los consejos\n• Aura TermoSleep: simulada (curva térmica)\n• Aura Sensor: Xiaomi Band vía Web Bluetooth (Chrome)\n  o sensor simulado si no conecta", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "• Dos apps: Cuidadora (pasiva) y Hijo/a (control)\n• Cuidadora: solo 3 cosas — Dormir, Sonidos,\n  Mi descanso. Sin mensajes, sin alertas\n• Hijo/a hace el setup y aplica los consejos\n• Aura TermoSleep: simulada (curva térmica)\n• Aura Sensor: Xiaomi Band vía Web Bluetooth (Chrome)\n  o sensor simulado si no conecta", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "aura_00014", "type": "rectangle", "x": 640, "y": 140, "width": 620, "height": 290, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "#e5dbff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1021295903, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 1470372124, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792561155081, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "c00E"}, {"id": "aura_00015", "type": "text", "x": 656, "y": 154, "width": 346.32, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1386520735, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 50602075, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792561155081, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "c00F", "text": "Reglas UX para la cuidadora (60 años)", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Reglas UX para la cuidadora (60 años)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "aura_00016", "type": "text", "x": 656, "y": 186, "width": 390.0, "height": 131.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 171998795, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 1128589070, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792561155081, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "c00G", "text": "• Texto ≥ 20 px, títulos ≥ 28 px\n• Botones ≥ 64 px de alto, ancho completo\n• Máximo 3 opciones por pantalla\n• Ícono + palabra, nunca solo ícono\n• Cero jerga: no \"eficiencia\", \"REM\", \"HRV\"\n• Modo noche cálido, sin luz azul\n• Nada que responder, todo se deshace con \"Volver\"", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "• Texto ≥ 20 px, títulos ≥ 28 px\n• Botones ≥ 64 px de alto, ancho completo\n• Máximo 3 opciones por pantalla\n• Ícono + palabra, nunca solo ícono\n• Cero jerga: no \"eficiencia\", \"REM\", \"HRV\"\n• Modo noche cálido, sin luz azul\n• Nada que responder, todo se deshace con \"Volver\"", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "aura_00017", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1280, "y": 140, "width": 620, "height": 290, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1999223940, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 780753602, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792561155081, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "c00H"}, {"id": "aura_00018", "type": "text", "x": 1296, "y": 154, "width": 224.64000000000001, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 851103620, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 256416750, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792561155081, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "c00I", "text": "Ciclo de la demo (5 min)", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Ciclo de la demo (5 min)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "aura_00019", "type": "text", "x": 1296, "y": 186, "width": 351.0, "height": 131.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2096750452, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 1164384347, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792561155081, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "c00J", "text": "1. Marta toca \"Dormir\" → la sábana enfría\n2. Noche simulada en 30 s → sueño bajo (68 %)\n3. Karen recibe alerta en su app\n4. Karen aplica consejos: enfriar antes +\n   tomar el turno de la abuela\n5. Segunda noche → 87 %\n6. Marta ve: \"☀ Descansaste bien\"", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "1. Marta toca \"Dormir\" → la sábana enfría\n2. Noche simulada en 30 s → sueño bajo (68 %)\n3. Karen recibe alerta en su app\n4. Karen aplica consejos: enfriar antes +\n   tomar el turno de la abuela\n5. Segunda noche → 87 %\n6. Marta ve: \"☀ Descansaste bien\"", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "aura_00020", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1920, "y": 140, "width": 620, "height": 290, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 687706015, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 603806810, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792561155081, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "c00K"}, {"id": "aura_00021", "type": "text", "x": 1936, "y": 154, "width": 168.48000000000002, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 790668079, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 1766007220, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792561155081, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "c00L", "text": "Preguntas abiertas", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Preguntas abiertas", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "aura_00022", "type": "text", "x": 1936, "y": 186, "width": 343.2, "height": 112.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 733934195, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 1405075296, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792561155081, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "c00M", "text": "• ¿Marta ve \"Hoy Karen cuida a la abuela\"?\n  (pasivo, sin responder)\n• ¿Modelo exacto de la banda Xiaomi?\n  (necesita \"Compartir frecuencia cardíaca\")\n• ¿Demo en portátil con Chrome?\n• ¿Música propia o solo sonidos generados?", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "• ¿Marta ve \"Hoy Karen cuida a la abuela\"?\n  (pasivo, sin responder)\n• ¿Modelo exacto de la banda Xiaomi?\n  (necesita \"Compartir frecuencia cardíaca\")\n• ¿Demo en portátil con Chrome?\n• ¿Música propia o solo sonidos generados?", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "aura_00023", "type": "text", "x": 0, "y": 560, "width": 954.72, "height": 45.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1591687968, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 315782749, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792561155081, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "c00N", "text": "1 · App de la cuidadora (Marta, celular, sin login)", "fontSize": 36, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "1 · App de la cuidadora (Marta, celular, sin login)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "aura_00024", "type": "text", "x": 0, "y": 610, "width": 786.24, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1115542852, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 259068389, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1792561155081, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "c00O", "text": "La familia la deja configurada. Ella solo duerme, pone sonidos y mira cómo descansó.", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "La familia la deja configurada. Ella solo duerme, pone sonidos y mira cómo descansó.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "aura_00025", "type": "frame", "x": 0, "y": 670, "width": 390, "height": 844, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 